{
  "_comment": [
    "Recipes reconciled from RateMyServer (quest_db type=10000) for products that",
    "extract-npc-recipes.js cannot capture automatically: multi-stage quests whose",
    "materials are delitem'd across several dialog steps (the producing `getitem`",
    "block holds no literal `delitem`), so NPC-level aggregation would pool the",
    "materials of unrelated items made by the same NPC. Sourced from RMS instead.",
    "JSON has no comments — `_comment` / `_name` keys are ignored by the loader.",
    "Each entry is a `produces` recipe: { product:{id,qty}, category, materials:[{id,qty}] }.",
    "Verify against the cited rAthena script line + RMS qid before trusting quantities."
